Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of the variable `i`, which was declared outside of the loop and not properly incremented within the loop, leading to a situation where the check on `i` did not make sense. This could result in an infinite loop or incorrect behavior in the function, as the loop condition would not be updated as expected.

